33175.a:
**Qisqa javob:** **Provider** — API bilan gaplashuvchi plagin (AWS, GCP, K8s); **resource** — Terraform yaratadigan/boshqaradigan obyekt; **data source** — mavjud narsani faqat o'qish; **variable** — kirish parametri; **output** — natijani tashqariga chiqarish. Resurslar orasidagi murojaatlardan Terraform dependency graph quradi.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
variable.region --> provider "aws"
data.aws_ami.ubuntu ----+
                        v
             resource aws_instance.web --> output.public_ip
```

**Amalda:**
```hcl
terraform {
  required_providers {
    aws = { source = "hashicorp/aws", version = "~> 5.60" }
  }
}

variable "region" {
  type    = string
  default = "eu-central-1"
}

provider "aws" { region = var.region }

data "aws_ami" "ubuntu" {
  most_recent = true
  owners      = ["099720109477"]   # Canonical
  filter {
    name   = "name"
    values = ["ubuntu/images/hvm-ssd-gp3/ubuntu-noble-24.04-amd64-server-*"]
  }
}

resource "aws_instance" "web" {
  ami           = data.aws_ami.ubuntu.id
  instance_type = "t3.micro"
  tags          = { Name = "web" }
}

output "public_ip" { value = aws_instance.web.public_ip }
```
Manzil formati: `<tur>.<nom>.<atribut>` — `aws_instance.web.id`, `data.aws_ami.ubuntu.id`.

**Tuzoqlar:**
- Provider versiyasini pin qilmaslik — yangi major versiya kodni buzadi.
- `most_recent = true` AMI — yangi AMI chiqqanda instance replace bo'ladi.
- Resource nomini (`web`) o'zgartirish = Terraform uchun eski o'chiriladi, yangi yaratiladi (`moved` kerak).

**Senior nuqta:** Implicit dependency (atributga murojaat) har doim `depends_on` dan yaxshi — graph aniq va parallel bajariladi.

33186.a:
**Qisqa javob:** `lifecycle` — Terraform'ning resursni qanday almashtirishi/o'chirishini boshqaradi. `prevent_destroy` — o'chirishga olib keladigan plan'ni xato bilan to'xtatadi (DB, bucket); `create_before_destroy` — replace'da avval yangisini yaratib, keyin eskisini o'chiradi (downtime yo'q); `ignore_changes` — tashqaridan boshqariladigan atributlarni e'tiborsiz qoldiradi.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
default replace:          destroy old -> create new     (oraliqda downtime)
create_before_destroy:    create new -> switch -> destroy old
prevent_destroy:          plan'da destroy bo'lsa -> Error
ignore_changes:           atribut farqi plan'da ko'rinmaydi
```

**Amalda:**
```hcl
resource "aws_db_instance" "main" {
  deletion_protection = true             # cloud darajasida ham
  lifecycle { prevent_destroy = true }
}

resource "aws_launch_template" "lt" {
  name_prefix = "api-"                    # nom to'qnashmasligi uchun
  lifecycle { create_before_destroy = true }
}

resource "aws_ecs_service" "api" {
  desired_count = 2
  lifecycle { ignore_changes = [desired_count] }   # autoscaler boshqaradi
}

resource "aws_instance" "web" {
  lifecycle {
    replace_triggered_by = [terraform_data.app_version]   # versiya o'zgarsa replace
  }
}
```

**Tuzoqlar:**
- `create_before_destroy` unique nomli resurslarda (bir xil `name`) to'qnashadi — `name_prefix` ishlating.
- `prevent_destroy` faqat Terraform ichida: resurs blokini koddan o'chirsangiz himoya ham ketadi. Shuning uchun cloud tomonidagi `deletion_protection` ham kerak.
- `ignore_changes = all` — drift'ni butunlay yashiradi; aniq atributlarni sanang.
- `create_before_destroy` bog'liq resurslarga ham tarqaladi — ular ham shu rejimga o'tadi.

**Senior nuqta:** Stateful resurslar (DB, bucket, KMS key) uchun ikki qatlamli himoya standart: `prevent_destroy` + provider'ning deletion protection'i + CI'da destroy uchun alohida tasdiq.

33214.a:
**Qisqa javob:** Reverse proxy — client so'rovini qabul qilib, ichkaridagi backend'ga uzatuvchi server. Nginx'da `location` ichida `proxy_pass http://backend;` va backend real client ma'lumotini bilishi uchun `proxy_set_header` bilan `Host`, `X-Real-IP`, `X-Forwarded-For`, `X-Forwarded-Proto` uzatiladi.

**Nega kerak:** ilova 8080 portda localhost'da tinglaydi; nginx 80/443'da TLS, gzip, statik fayl, rate limit, load balancing qiladi. Ilova internetga to'g'ridan ochilmaydi.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
client 1.2.3.4 --HTTPS--> nginx :443 --HTTP--> app 127.0.0.1:8080
                          + X-Forwarded-For: 1.2.3.4
                          + X-Forwarded-Proto: https
                          + Host: api.example.com
```

**Amalda:**
```nginx
upstream app { server 127.0.0.1:8080; keepalive 16; }

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name api.example.com;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://app;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Connection        "";
        proxy_set_header Host              $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP         $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For   $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_connect_timeout 5s;
        proxy_read_timeout    60s;
    }
}
```
```bash
sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
curl -I http://api.example.com
```

**`proxy_pass` slash nozikligi:**
| Konfig | `/api/users` so'rovi backend'ga |
|---|---|
| `location /api/ { proxy_pass http://app; }` | `/api/users` |
| `location /api/ { proxy_pass http://app/; }` | `/users` (prefiks kesiladi) |

**Tuzoqlar:**
- Header'larsiz backend hamma so'rovni `127.0.0.1`dan deb ko'radi, redirect'lar `http://` va noto'g'ri host bilan chiqadi.
- `X-Forwarded-For`ni client o'zi soxtalashtira oladi — ilova unga faqat ishonchli proxy IP'lardan kelganda ishonsin.
- `proxy_pass`da hostname bo'lsa, nginx DNS'ni faqat start'da resolve qiladi — IP o'zgarsa eski joyga ketadi (`resolver` + o'zgaruvchi yoki upstream `resolve`).

**Senior nuqta:** Timeout'lar zanjiri izchil bo'lsin: LB > nginx > ilova > DB. Aks holda tashqi qatlam ichkidan oldin uzib, "yetim" so'rovlar ishlashda davom etadi.

33218.a:
```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name example.com;
    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;
}
server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    http2 on;
    server_name example.com;
    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem;
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
