    add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains" always;
}
```
- `fullchain.pem` (intermediate bilan) — faqat `cert.pem` bo'lsa ba'zi client'lar "unable to verify" beradi.
- HSTS'ni yoqishdan oldin hamma subdomain HTTPS'da ekaniga ishonch hosil qiling (qaytarib olish qiyin).
- Tekshirish: `testssl.sh`, SSL Labs.

33219.a:
**Qisqa javob:** `upstream` blokida backend serverlar ro'yxati beriladi, `proxy_pass http://<upstream>` ular orasida yuklamani taqsimlaydi. Algoritmlar: default round-robin, `least_conn`, `ip_hash`, `hash <key>`, `weight`. Open source nginx'da **passive** health check (`max_fails`/`fail_timeout`); active health check — NGINX Plus yoki tashqi vosita.

**Nega kerak:** bitta backend — SPOF va o'tkazish chegarasi. Bir nechta instansiya ortida LB bilan biri o'lsa ham xizmat ishlaydi.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
            +--> 10.0.1.10  (ok)
client -> nginx --> 10.0.1.11  (3 marta xato -> 10s chiqariladi)
            +--> 10.0.1.12  backup (faqat hammasi yiqilsa)
```

**Amalda:**
```nginx
upstream api {
    least_conn;                                       # eng kam aktiv ulanishli server
    server 10.0.1.10:8080 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=10s;
    server 10.0.1.11:8080 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=10s weight=2;
    server 10.0.1.12:8080 backup;
    keepalive 32;                                     # backend ulanishlarini qayta ishlatish
}
server {
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://api;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Connection "";               # keepalive uchun shart
        proxy_next_upstream error timeout http_502;
        proxy_next_upstream_tries 2;
    }
}
```

| Algoritm | Qachon |
|---|---|
| round-robin | so'rovlar bir xil, oddiy holat |
| `least_conn` | so'rov davomiyligi har xil, uzun so'rovlar |
| `ip_hash` | oddiy sticky session (NAT ortida notekis) |
| `hash $key consistent` | cache serverlar, shard bo'yicha |

Access log'ga `$upstream_addr $upstream_status $upstream_response_time` qo'shib qaysi backend sekinligini ko'r.

**Tuzoqlar:**
- Passive health check faqat real so'rov xato berganda ishlaydi — ba'zi foydalanuvchilar baribir xato ko'radi.
- `proxy_next_upstream` POST'ni ham qayta yuborishi mumkin (`non_idempotent` qo'shilsa) — to'lovni ikki marta yechish xavfi. Default'da non-idempotent qayta yuborilmaydi — shunday qoldir.
- `keepalive` bor, lekin `Connection ""` va HTTP/1.1 yo'q — ulanishlar qayta ishlatilmaydi.

**Senior nuqta:** Sticky session'ga tayanish — ilova stateful degani; session'ni Redis/DB'ga chiqarib stateless qil. Cloud'da managed LB (ALB/NLB) active health check bilan odatda nginx'ning o'z balansidan ishonchliroq.

33221.a:
**Qisqa javob:** Nginx'da `limit_req` (so'rov tezligi, leaky bucket) va `limit_conn` (bir vaqtdagi ulanishlar) bilan IP bo'yicha cheklov qo'yiladi; qo'shimcha himoya: `server_tokens off`, `client_max_body_size`, timeout'lar, xavfsizlik header'lari, faqat TLS 1.2/1.3. Maqsad — brute force, scraping va oddiy DoS'dan backend'ni himoya qilish.

**Muammo:** login endpoint'ga sekundiga minglab parol urinishi yoki bitta bot hamma worker'larni band qilishi — ilova o'zi buni arzon to'xtata olmaydi.

**Qanday ishlaydi (leaky bucket):**
```
so'rovlar --> [ chelak: burst=20 ] --> 10 r/s tezlikda o'tadi
              to'lsa --> 429 (limit_req_status)
nodelay: burst ichidagilar kutmasdan o'tadi, ortig'i darhol rad
```

**Amalda:**
```nginx
http {
    limit_req_zone  $binary_remote_addr zone=login:10m rate=5r/m;
    limit_req_zone  $binary_remote_addr zone=api:10m   rate=10r/s;
    limit_conn_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=conn:10m;

    server_tokens off;                # versiyani yashirish
    client_max_body_size 10m;
    client_body_timeout 10s;
    client_header_timeout 10s;

    server {
        add_header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000" always;
        add_header X-Content-Type-Options nosniff always;

        location = /api/login {
            limit_req zone=login burst=5 nodelay;
            limit_req_status 429;
            proxy_pass http://api;
        }
        location /api/ {
            limit_req zone=api burst=20 nodelay;
            limit_conn conn 20;
            proxy_pass http://api;
        }
    }
}
```
```bash
sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
for i in $(seq 1 30); do curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code} ' https://site/api/x; done
# 200 200 ... 429 429   <- limit ishlayapti
grep 'limiting requests' /var/log/nginx/error.log
```

**Tuzoqlar:**
- Nginx LB/CDN ortida bo'lsa `$remote_addr` = LB IP — hamma foydalanuvchi bitta limitga tushadi. Tuzatish: `set_real_ip_from <LB CIDR>; real_ip_header X-Forwarded-For; real_ip_recursive on;` — faqat ishonchli manbadan.
- Korporativ NAT ortidagi yuzlab foydalanuvchi bitta IP — limitni juda past qo'yma; autentifikatsiyalangan API uchun API key/user bo'yicha limit yaxshiroq.
- `add_header` ichki blokda yozilsa tashqi bloklardagi `add_header`lar meros olinmaydi.

**Senior nuqta:** Nginx limit — birinchi qatlam, bitta node xotirasida. Haqiqiy DDoS'ga qarshi CDN/WAF (Cloudflare, AWS Shield/WAF) kerak; ko'p node'da global limit Redis asosida ilova/gateway darajasida. Login uchun qo'shimcha — akkaunt bo'yicha lockout va MFA.

