O'lchang: `stub_status`/nginx-exporter, `$request_time` vs `$upstream_response_time` — kechikish Nginx'dami yoki backend'da.

33223.a:
**Qisqa javob:** **WebSocket** HTTP/1.1 `Upgrade` mexanizmi bilan boshlanadi — nginx `Upgrade` va `Connection` header'larini backend'ga ochiq uzatishi va uzoq jim ulanishlar uchun `proxy_read_timeout`ni oshirishi kerak. **gRPC** HTTP/2 ustida ishlaydi — `http2 on` va `proxy_pass` o'rniga `grpc_pass` ishlatiladi.

**Muammo:** default nginx hop-by-hop header'larni (`Upgrade`, `Connection`) uzatmaydi va backend'ga HTTP/1.0 bilan boradi — WebSocket ulanmaydi. 60s jimlikdan keyin ulanish uziladi. gRPC'ni oddiy `proxy_pass` bilan proxy qilib bo'lmaydi.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
WebSocket:
client: GET /ws  Upgrade: websocket, Connection: Upgrade
nginx  -> backend (shu header'lar bilan, HTTP/1.1)
backend: 101 Switching Protocols  --> endi ikki tomonlama TCP oqim

gRPC:
client --HTTP/2 (TLS)--> nginx :443 http2 --grpc_pass--> backend :9090 (h2c yoki grpcs)
```

**Amalda:**
```nginx
map $http_upgrade $connection_upgrade {
    default upgrade;
    ''      close;
}

server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    http2 on;                       # nginx 1.25.1+ sintaksisi
    server_name app.example.com;

    location /ws/ {
        proxy_pass http://ws_backend;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade    $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection $connection_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Host       $host;
        proxy_read_timeout 1h;      # default 60s: jim ulanish uziladi
    }

    location /payments.v1.PaymentService/ {
        grpc_pass grpc://10.0.1.20:9090;      # TLS backend uchun grpcs://
        grpc_read_timeout 300s;               # streaming RPC uchun
        grpc_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
```
```bash
websocat wss://app.example.com/ws/
grpcurl app.example.com:443 list
```

**Tuzoqlar:**
- `proxy_read_timeout`ni oshirmay, ilovada ping/pong (heartbeat) ham yo'q — ulanishlar har 60s'da uziladi.
- Reload'da eski worker WebSocket ulanishlari tugaguncha yashaydi (xotira o'sadi) — `worker_shutdown_timeout 30s` va client'da reconnect + backoff.
- Ko'p WebSocket — har biri fd; `worker_connections` va `LimitNOFILE`ni oshir.
- Eski `listen 443 ssl http2;` sintaksisi deprecated — yangi versiyada `http2 on;`.

**Senior nuqta:** Uzoq yashovchi ulanishlar deploy va load balancing'ni murakkablashtiradi: yangi instansiyaga yuk o'tmaydi, drain uzoq. Ulanish yoshini cheklash (server tomonidan qayta ulanishga majburlash) va gRPC'da client-side yoki L7 balancing (har so'rov bo'yicha) rejalashtiriladi.
